              Join Cond: (runs.id = __mo_index_pri_col)  𝄀
              Runtime Filter Build: #[-1,0]  𝄀
              ->  Table Scan on regular_index_point_skew.runs [ForceOneCN]  𝄀
                    Filter Cond: (runs.workflow_id = 1), (runs.workspace_id = 1), (runs.task_id = 7)  𝄀
                    Block Filter Cond: (runs.workflow_id = 1), (runs.workspace_id = 1), (runs.task_id = 7)  𝄀
